    "description": "Multi-layer spam and abuse protection for public-facing forms, registration flows, and community content. Combines honeypot fields, content pattern analysis, CAPTCHA (reCAPTCHA v3 / hCaptcha), IP reputation scoring, automatic IP blocking, and a moderation quarantine queue \u2014 all configurable without code. Fires workflow triggers on every spam event and exposes workflow actions to block IPs, approve/reject quarantine items, and scan arbitrary content on demand.",
